  "url": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7065512/",
  "notes": "Extracted from the primary paper (snippet: The composition of minimal medium (14) is as follows (in grams/liter): FeSO4-7H2O, 1.25 x 10-4; (NH4)2SO4, 0.5; MgSO4-7H2O, 0.05; KH2PO4, 3.4. The pH was adjusted to 7.0 with 1 M KOH.). Component names mapped to BiGG (see mapping_confidence); presence-based bounds unless the paper gave exchange bounds; concentration_mM where units allowed. Extraction confidence: high.",
  "verification": "paper-verified (complete recipe; cited + supplementary sources chased)",
  "verification_evidence": "redistributed in minimal medium supplemented with labeled glucose (0.5%, wt/vol) with four replicates",
  "verification_confidence": "high",
  "base_medium": "MP medium (a.k.a. minimal medium/MM for Ralstonia solanacearum) - a defined 4-salt minimal medium; Ray et al. 2015 cite it as MP medium from Plener et al. 2010, J Bacteriol 192:1011-1019.",
  "recuration": {
   "date": "2026-07-16",
   "round": "complete-recipe (cited+supplementary chased)",
   "status": "confirmed",
   "confidence": "high",
   "sources_chased": [
